   "titulo": "Read schedules",
   "texto": [
    "**Rutetabell** is the published schedule of a route; **avgang** is the output and **ankomst**, the arrival.",
    "**Reisetid** indicates how long the trip lasts. In Norwegian, time is usually expressed with **klokka** followed by time: **klokka ni** («at 9: 00»)."
